      "title": "神秘酒款 1 號 (Mystery Wine 1)",
      "content": "<div class=\"prose max-w-none\"><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6\">請仔細閱讀以下品飲筆記，並在心中推演可能的品種。</p><div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 mb-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8\"><div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3 flex flex-col items-center justify-center border-r border-gray-200 pr-6\"><div class=\"w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-red-400 to-orange-300 mb-4 shadow-inner\"></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800\">Wine 1</h3><p class=\"text-gray-500\">紅葡萄酒</p><div class=\"mt-4 w-full\"><div class=\"flex justify-between text-sm mb-1\"><span>酸度</span><span class=\"font-bold text-red-600\">高</span></div><div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"bg-red-500 h-2 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 95%\"></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-between text-sm mb-1\"><span>單寧</span><span class=\"font-bold text-red-600\">高 (抓舌感強)</span></div><div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"bg-red-500 h-2 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 95%\"></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-between text-sm mb-1\"><span>酒體</span><span class=\"font-bold text-gray-600\">中等至飽滿</span></div><div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-2\"><div class=\"bg-gray-500 h-2 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 80%\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 border-b pb-2\">品飲筆記 (Tasting Notes)</h4><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg\"><span class=\"block font-bold text-gray-700 mb-1\">外觀 (Sight)</span><span class=\"text-gray-600\">顏色偏淺，呈現寶石紅，但邊緣有非常明顯的<strong>橘紅色 (Garnet/Orange rim)</strong>。</span></div><div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg\"><span class=\"block font-bold text-gray-700 mb-1\">香氣 (Aroma)</span><span class=\"text-gray-600\">香氣濃郁且複雜。明顯的<strong>玫瑰花瓣 (Dried Roses)</strong>、紅櫻桃、覆盆子，伴隨著<strong>焦油 (Tar)</strong>、甘草、皮革與一絲松露的氣息。</span></div><div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg\"><span class=\"block font-bold text-gray-700 mb-1\">口感 (Palate)</span><span class=\"text-gray-600\">入口酸度極高，令人流口水。單寧非常強烈且緊實，覆蓋整個口腔。尾韻悠長，帶有乾燥花與香料味。</span></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
