果香氣。</span></div><div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg\"><span class=\"block font-bold text-gray-700 mb-1\">口感 (Palate)</span><span class=\"text-gray-600\">酸度高但口感圓潤飽滿，質地如奶油般滑順 (Creamy)。成熟的果香與酵母味完美融合，尾韻悠長。</span></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
